ms",[63],{"_59":60,"_25":64},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game/7758caa8d9578f19780349e7b4e4115ef831fd7a/examples/project-plateau/build/evidence/current-run/01-field-glade.jpg","text","mediaReviewed","Screenshot source reviewed","value","2026-10-20","image","gameplay","A creator-published frame from the recorded expedition, showing the field camera, animal family and remaining daylight.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/project-plateau.webp","alt","The player’s field camera points toward a prehistoric animal family beside a brook, with photographic plate and daylight indicators.","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game/blob/7758caa8d9578f19780349e7b4e4115ef831fd7a/examples/project-plateau/build/evidence/current-run/01-field-glade.jpg","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)",[88],"Other / unspecified agent","Related resources",[93],"resourceIds","section",{"_59":94,"_25":95},"Three.js","/resources/threejs/","Creator evidence",[99],"evidence",{"_59":100,"_25":101,"_102":103},"Read the creator’s adaptation and QA account","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game#what-the-qa-record-admits-it-did-not-test","note","The author explains the recorded camera-to-result-and-restart route and its limits; GameMap is not claiming to have reproduced that complete route.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[108],{"_59":109,"_25":110,"_102":111},"Open the full expedition project","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game/tree/main/examples/project-plateau","Three.js/Vite game with local runtime models, textures, sound, source adaptation documents and QA inputs. Requires Node 22.12+ for local tooling. Blender scripts are asset-production sources, not required for normal play.","Access type","playable","demo","Play or run",[117],{"_59":118,"_25":119,"_102":120},"Play Project Plateau","https://plateau.vibecoco.ai/","Desktop landscape browser with WebGL2, keyboard and mouse. Mobile devices may show the creator’s short recorded preview instead of the full game.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","build log","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[128],{"_59":129,"_25":110,"_102":-7},"Read the expedition build and design workspace","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[134,135,136,137],"Start the desktop expedition and learn movement, camera, crouching and return-to-camp controls.","Compare how subject framing, cover and photographic plates create choices from the novel’s expedition premise.","Read the build brief and verification record to separate a tested route from untested device, sound and optional encounter behavior.","For local play, enter examples/project-plateau/build/app, use Node 22.12+ to install dependencies, then run npm start; the committed runtime assets do not require Blender regeneration.","AI workflow / foundation context","The creator presents Project Plateau as a NovelToGame adaptation built through analysis, concept, world design, art direction, implementation and QA stages. The public workspace includes game code, committed models and textures, asset-generation scripts and the input trace for one tested path; its coding client is not explicitly identified.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","provenance","Track","3D","track","metadata","Asset creation tools",false,[154],"assetTools","Blender","Engine","Three.js · WebGL2","engine","lead",[154],"3d",[134,135,136,137],{"_59":129,"_25":110,"_17":171},{"_59":118,"_25":119,"_17":113,"_102":120},{"_59":109,"_25":110,"_102":111,"_169":170},{"_59":100,"_25":101,"_102":103},[168],"ai-assisted","threejs","scope","complete-project","build-log",{"_173":174},"documents",{"_175":176,"_177":178},"en",[180,184,185,186,183,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,182,219,181,220,22